@plantId = 6203ddf0-52a1-4251-bafa-193f694d7601
@alertRuleId = 1ccc2868-4fd3-464f-bb86-8dd7d0f93519
@alertId = replace-with-alert-id
@from = 2026-06-01T00:00:00Z
@to = 2026-07-01T00:00:00Z

### Get All Alerts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/alerts

### Get Alert By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/alerts/{{alertId}}

### Get Active Alerts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/alerts?status=ACTIVE

### Get Resolved Alerts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/alerts?status=RESOLVED

### Get Critical Alerts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/alerts?severity=CRITICAL

### Get Alerts By Alert Rule
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/alerts?alertRuleId={{alertRuleId}}

### Get Alerts By Plant
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/alerts?plantId={{plantId}}

### Get Alerts By Time Range
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/alerts?from={{from}}&to={{to}}

### Get Active Critical Alerts By Plant
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/alerts?status=ACTIVE&severity=CRITICAL&plantId={{plantId}}

### Validation: Invalid Status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/alerts?status=OPEN

### Validation: Invalid Time Range
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/alerts?from={{to}}&to={{from}}
